---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contribute — AI Red Team Framework"
  description="How to contribute battle-tested attack patterns, tool reviews, and playbook improvements."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-700">Contribute</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-semibold text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight text-ink-900 mt-2">Contribute to the framework</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-prose-wide mt-8">
      <p>Especially valued: red teamers with field experience submitting battle-tested patterns, tooling reviews with honest limitations, and playbook improvements rooted in real engagements.</p>

      <h2>Quality bar</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Patterns: framed as <em>how to test defenses against</em>, not as offensive recipes. ≥ 2 framework mappings, ≥ 2 references.</li>
        <li>Tool reviews: include explicit "not for" entries. No vendor-supplied marketing copy.</li>
        <li>Playbook contributions: real-world tone, draws from named engagements (sanitized) rather than abstract advice.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Ethics</h2>
      <p>Read <a href="/ethics">ETHICS</a> before contributing. This is a defensive resource; we do not host weaponized payloads or zero-days.</p>

      <h2>How to submit</h2>
      <p>Open a PR at <a href="https://github.com/emmanuelgjr/AI-RedTeam-Framework">github.com/emmanuelgjr/AI-RedTeam-Framework</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
